1
00:00:05,531 --> 00:00:08,931
(Mrs Cooper:)Shelly, I'm so proud of you and
Leonard for getting this award.

2
00:00:08,936 --> 00:00:10,806
(Sheldon:)Oh, thank you, Mother.

3
00:00:10,804 --> 00:00:12,804
(Mrs Cooper:)I tried to read your paper,
but it was very hard

4
00:00:12,806 --> 00:00:14,106
(Mrs Cooper:)for me to understand.

5
00:00:14,108 --> 00:00:16,108
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's quite
straightforward, actually.

6
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:18,640
(Sheldon:)It describes a new model
of the universe

7
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:21,075
(Sheldon:)that conceptualizes it
as the surface

8
00:00:21,081 --> 00:00:22,651
(Sheldon:)of an n-dimensional
superfluid.

9
00:00:22,649 --> 00:00:23,649
(Mrs Cooper:)Interesting.

10
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,980
(Mrs Cooper:)You can believe that,

11
00:00:24,985 --> 00:00:29,155
(Mrs Cooper:)but God filling an ark with
animals two-by-two is nonsense.

12
00:00:31,124 --> 00:00:35,064
(Sheldon:)What did they feed
the lions, Mother?

13
00:00:35,062 --> 00:00:39,832
(Mrs Cooper:)The floating bodies of
drowned sinners, of course.

14
00:00:42,935 --> 00:00:46,635
(Sheldon:)Listen, Leonard's mom is
a renowned psychiatrist

15
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,170
(Sheldon:)and woman of science.

16
00:00:48,175 --> 00:00:51,005
(Sheldon:)Can you please keep
the Bible babble to yourself

17
00:00:51,011 --> 00:00:52,411
(Sheldon:)while she's here?

18
00:00:52,412 --> 00:00:54,182
(Mrs Cooper:)Are you ashamed of me?

19
00:00:54,181 --> 00:00:57,451
(Sheldon:)Of course not.
I love you.

20
00:00:57,451 --> 00:01:04,021
(Sheldon:)I'm just embarrassed by the
things you believe, do and say.

